# Nothing is required yet. The call form opens the visitor's email app until an email key is added.

# Ogi, the chat assistant (lib/ogi/model.ts). With no GEMINI_API_KEY, the chat shows "Ogi is resting".
# The Gemini free tier is for demos only: Google may use free-tier requests to improve its products, and limits are small.
# Move to a paid tier before real visitors depend on Ogi.
BOT_MODEL_PROVIDER=
BOT_MODEL=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
